1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
@HuazhongGurenScene{SFX:Play|name=canal_morning|baseVolume=0.24|endTime=65.5}{Music:Play|name=umbrella_sun_theme|fadeIn=2.2|baseVolume=0.27|endTime=67.0}

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,600
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}江南的雨季，有些人卖伞，有些人卖画。

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,800
[Girl]{Voice:bright}小蓝两样都不买，只抱着一把破伞，站到阿澈摊前。

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,200
[Girl]{Voice:curious}能不能替我在伞里，画个太阳？

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,200
[Boy]{Voice:curious}太阳？伞撑开时，旁人可看不见。

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}我自己看得见就好。

7
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,200
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}下雨时，人总得有个抬头的理由。

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,400
[Girl]{Voice:calm}阿澈没笑她。他把伞翻过来，磨了一碟金粉。

9
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,700
{SFX:Play|name=inkstone_grind|baseVolume=0.44}

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,200
[Boy]{Voice:bright}别动。你的影子，挡住我的太阳了。

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,800
[Girl]{Voice:curious}你到底在画伞，还是画我？

12
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,200
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}先画伞。你……顺手。

13
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}油嘴滑舌。

14
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,600
{SFX:Play|name=wind_gust|baseVolume=0.78}{SFX:Play|name=umbrella_snap|baseVolume=0.74|offset=0.25}

15
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,200
[Girl]{Voice:bright}伞！

16
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:55,500
{SFX:Play|name=running_stone|baseVolume=0.58}

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,700
[Boy]{Voice:bright}抓到了！

18
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:02,100
[Girl]{Voice:bright}你抓到的是我的袖子。

19
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,800
[Boy]{Voice:curious}……抱歉。

20
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,000
[Girl]{Voice:calm}两个人还没站稳，雨先追了上来。

21
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:40,500
{SFX:Play|name=canal_rain|baseVolume=0.35|endTime=100.5}{Music:Stop|name=umbrella_sun_theme|fadeOut=1.5}{Music:Play|name=rain_gold_theme|fadeIn=1.5|baseVolume=0.29|endTime=128.5}

22
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,300
[Boy]{Voice:worried}金粉没干，会花。

23
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,300
[Girl]{Voice:bright}那就撑起来。

24
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:22,500
{SFX:Play|name=umbrella_open|baseVolume=0.62}{SFX:Play|name=cloth_rain|baseVolume=0.28|endTime=100.5}

25
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,400
[Girl]{Voice:bright}你画的太阳，在漏雨。

26
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,500
[Boy]{Voice:bright}太阳第一次淋雨，难免失礼。

27
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,200
[Girl]{Voice:bright}它倒比你会道歉。

28
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,500
{SFX:Play|name=rain_easing|baseVolume=0.34|endTime=104.5}

29
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,300
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}你看，真的放晴了。

30
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}不是我画得好。

31
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:52,000
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}是你把伞撑过来了。

32
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}那明天，再替我画一把。

33
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:59,200
[Boy]{Voice:curious}还画太阳？

34
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:04,000
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}不。画两个等雨的人。

35
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:08,500
{SFX:Play|name=canal_after_rain|baseVolume=0.25|endTime=128.5}{Music:Stop|name=rain_gold_theme|fadeOut=4.5}
